    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No. 52 Glenville Avenue to the market. This superb 3 bedroom semi-detached property that enjoys great location that is within walking distance of Coolmine Train Station and a host of local amenities, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families, and commuters alike.\nInternally, the property offers well-proportioned and spacious accommodation throughout. Upon entering, you are welcomed by a bright entrance hallway with guest w.c located just off the hallway which leads to a large living/dining room to the front of the property. A door provides access to the fully fitted kitchen, creating a practical and versatile living space. A substantial garage completes the ground floor accommodation and offers excellent potential for conversion, subject to the necessary planning permission, making it ideal for a home office, playroom, or additional living accommodation.\nUpstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, comprising two double bedrooms and one single bedroom, together with a spacious family bathroom.\nThe rear garden is a standout feature of the property, offering a generous outdoor space laid mainly in lawn. There is ample room to further extend the property, subject to planning permission. To the front, a private driveway provides off-street parking for up to three cars.\nWith its spacious accommodation, conversion potential, large garden, and highly convenient location, No. 52 Glenville Avenue presents an excellent opportunity for purchasers seeking a well-located family home in a mature and established residential setting.\n52 Glenville Avenue is close to St. Francis Xavier National School and Roselawn Shopping Centre. It is a most convenient location, Blanchardstown Village is within walking distance and the Blanchardstown SC is nearby. Castleknock Village is easily reached as is the Phoenix Park. There is an excellent bus service to City Centre and Castleknock & Coolmine Train Stations are within walking distance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - \nGlazed sliding doors and tiled floor.\n\nEntrance Hall - 4.33 x 2.72\nWelcoming hallway, with wooden flooring, open under stair storage, guest w.c located just of the hall and alarm panel.\n\nGuest W.C - 1.45 x 1.03\nLocated just off the hall with w.c and wash hand basin.\n\nLiving / Dining Room - 8.18 x 3.36\nA large bright room with laminate wood flooring, TV point, open fire and open plan to dining room.\n\nKitchen - 4.34 x 3.39\nA modern, fitted kitchen with, tiled flooring, ample wall and floor storage units. stainless steel sink with tiled splash back, built in oven and hob. Access to rear garden.\n\nLanding - \nWith carpet flooring and walk in hot press\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.32 x 3.35\nA large double bedrooom located to the rear of the property. With carpet flooring and fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.37 x 3.31\nDouble bedroom to the front of the property with built in wardrobes and carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.76 x 2.64\nSingle bedroom to the rear of the property, with carpet flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3.15 x 1.59\nFully tiled wall and floor. w.c, wash hand basin, and shower\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Three Bed Semi Detached </li><li>Large front garden</li><li>Double Glazed Windows Throughout </li><li>Garage attched </li><li>O.F.C.H</ul>"
      },
